<http://data.silknow.org/object/83467b3c-2ddd-383f-bec7-ff1d2264d569/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nThe left hand side is not vertical - it slopes outwards towards the top.  Double-sided embroidery on hand-made black silk net. There is a narrow 3-part border with a line of pink and dark red chevrons either side of band in which 3 blue bars are between a dark red cross and a dark blue cross. The central area has a directional design of a green straight stem with many grey flowers alternating with an angled dark green stem with a pair of light green and faded pink flowers half way along and a large flower at the top with 3 pairs of light and dark green long thin leaves and a pink and dark red flower.  There are small white flowers in lines of 3 between the two main motifs."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/83467b3c-2ddd-383f-bec7-ff1d2264d569> .

<http://data.silknow.org/production/e686377e-9fc4-3ae2-b83f-80d8bcc963b5>
